  "title": "The MotoVan",
  "date": "2023-06-16",
  "excerpt": "Mammoth Build Tier",
  "body": [
    "Got a passion for dirtbiking? This van's got your name on it! Tailored for a client whose heart beats for the buzz of the racetrack, it's the ultimate mobile garage. We've repurposed a Ford Transit into a Motovan, fitting it with an automatic bed lift to tuck away your bike safely during transit.",
    "The clever design doesn't stop there; there's an extra comfy seating/sleeping space upfront, coupled with a cooler-style fridge and storage underneath.",
    "If a Motovan sounds like your kind of ride, don't hesitate to reach out. We'll put our heads together to craft a design that's as unique as your biking journey!"
  ],
